 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lh5IHzd1vP8Q7kNvwEpM6U4&_nc_oc=Adp0ImvBnrFovUTwZmUHCLeIIhmuBEfSYPaUmdOdJei5fTbOiAi5E6Sr6uvgS5NLJ88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWbIG2kpB4dX52iYezK_0T0jYnSrrAWomuYHOfgeypMxA&oe=6B0EFF63"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oHJ6W4OJK7MQ7kNvwFctOcq&_nc_oc=AdrLuT1iobyjl7n2zno5NHftczOzV5f-8-vD13QABVxs4gWUawr5-ju8_nWAFYyQXxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUoZ-w0QQi8CTds3mOM5ljMdtmNTn8C5A7yxX_9B-QPHQ&oe=6B0EEB5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f73s_vm0qaQQ7kNvwEWin73&_nc_oc=AdoQscUz74R5AHLYsXGsm5oW7MbE8bvo_trJvhK0kFNQqnReZR02j0J2hYbrkCdL718&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV3CbkOuoAZ-zNIf99Cs8JOO9